<section class="fric-section">
  <div class="wrap fric-inner">
    <div class="fric-icon">
      <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.4"><path d="M22 2L11 13"/><path d="M22 2l-7 20-4-9-9-4z"/></svg>
    </div>
    <h2>VOCÊ MANDA A FOTO. A GENTE CUIDA DO RESTO.</h2>
    <p>Chame no WhatsApp, envie sua foto e receba as instruções para começar sua montagem.</p>
  </div>
</section>

<style>
  .fric-section{
    background: linear-gradient(135deg, var(--dourado-2), var(--dourado));
    color: var(--preto);
    padding: 26px 0;
    text-align:center;
  }
  .fric-inner{
    display:flex;
    flex-direction:column;
    align-items:center;
    gap:6px;
  }
  .fric-icon{
    width:34px; height:34px;
    border-radius:50%;
    background: rgba(74,5,5,0.12);
    display:flex; align-items:center; justify-content:center;
    margin-bottom:6px;
  }
  .fric-icon svg{ width:17px; height:17px; }
  .fric-section h2{
    font-size: 18px;
    margin-bottom: 4px;
  }
  .fric-section p{
    font-size: 13.5px;
    font-weight: 600;
    max-width: 320px;
    margin: 0 auto;
    opacity: 0.8;
  }
  @media(min-width:900px){
    .fric-section h2{ font-size:24px; }
    .fric-section p{ max-width:560px; font-size:15px; }
  }
</style>
